            <h3>Terminals at Dallas/Fort Worth</h3>
            <p>DFW operates five terminals (A, B, C, D, E), each serving distinct airline groupings and connected by the Skylink automated people mover.</p>
            <h4>Terminal A</h4>
            <p>Primarily serves American Airlines domestic operations.</p>
            <h4>Terminal B</h4>
            <p>Primarily serves American Eagle regional operations.</p>
            <h4>Terminal C</h4>
            <p>Exclusively American Airlines with extensive domestic and international check-in.</p>
            <h4>Terminal D</h4>
            <p>The international terminal, handling all overseas flights including American's London service and foreign carriers.</p>
            <b>Facilities:</b>
            <ul>
                <li>International check-in and customs/immigration</li>
                <li>Airline lounges including American Flagship, British Airways, Lufthansa, and Qantas</li>
                <li>Duty-free shopping and international dining</li>
            </ul>
            <h4>Terminal E</h4>
            <p>Primarily serves Delta, United, Spirit, and other domestic carriers.</p>
            <h3>Transportation to Dallas/Fort Worth</h3>
            <h4>DART Orange Line</h4>
            <p>Light rail connection to downtown Dallas.</p>
            <b>Benefits:</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Most affordable option at approximately $3.00</li>
                <li>Journey time 50-60 minutes to downtown</li>
                <li>Direct connection to Dallas Love Field for alternative routing</li>
            </ul>
            <h4>Taxi and Rideshare</h4>
            <p>Uber, Lyft, and traditional taxis serve all terminals.</p>
            <b>Travel times:</b>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Off-peak:</b> 25-35 minutes from downtown Dallas</li>
                <li><b>Rush hour:</b> 40-60 minutes</li>
                <li><b>Cost: </b>$35-$55</li>
            </ul>
            <h4>Driving and Parking</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Terminal Parking:</b> Adjacent to each terminal at premium rates</li>
                <li><b>Express Parking:</b> Covered option with shuttle service</li>
