            <h3>Heathrow Terminals</h3>
            <h4>Terminal 2 (The Queen's Terminal)</h4>
            <p>Serves Star Alliance carriers including United, Lufthansa, and Air Canada.</p>
            <h4>Terminal 3</h4>
