            <p>Serves SkyTeam carriers including Air France, KLM, and Delta.</p>
            <h4>Terminal 5</h4>
            <p>British Airways' exclusive domain.</p>
            <h3>Immigration and Customs at Heathrow</h3>
            <p>Passengers arriving from Dallas proceed through UK entry controls.</p>
            <b>Requirements:</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Valid passport</li>
                <li>Electronic Travel Authorization (ETA) for US citizens</li>
                <li>Proof of accommodation</li>
                <li>Return or onward travel documentation</li>
            </ul>
            <p>US citizens enjoy visa-free access for tourism stays up to six months.</p>
